    "detailed_description": "Soul Dungeons shape themselves after their controller\u2019s soul, holding the key to the island's survival. The Belmonte family's control over these dungeons gives them power over the island, but rumors suggest their involvement with a cult and a connection to your parents' disappearance. As a hunter with hidden abilities, you're tasked not only with capturing monsters but also with aiding the island's inhabitants and uncovering your true identity.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1400750/extras/cfbdb117db27392cce2f320ae9b2550e.avif?t=1736188621\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Over 100 Ammons:</h2>There's a whole world of monsters just waiting to be captured. You might even be lucky enough to stumble upon a legendary Ammon! What's an Ammon? Ammo + Monster<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1400750/extras/0947be46c21e25d8ff95e187a7cdb150.avif?t=1736188621\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Legendary Casters:</h2>Legendary weapons known as casters are scattered around the island. These weapons, accessible to those fortunate enough to find them, hold immense power and allow for extraordinary battle strategies.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1400750/extras/a04e6555686f1ad26a13e92e5e55122c.avif?t=1736188621\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multiplayer:</h2>Though primarily a single-player experience, the game also offers multiplayer aspects.<br><br>- PvP Battles: <br>Prove your skill in PvP battles. Show your friends and fellow hunters who has the ultimate squad.<br><br>- Monster Trading: <br>Expand your Ammon collection by trading with friends and players worldwide. <br><strong></strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Designed for Virtual Reality!<br></li><li>Capture and catalog over 100 unique Ammons. <br></li><li>Voiced single player story<br></li><li>Turn Based ATB Combat System <br></li><li>Diverse Exploration Areas: Unearth secrets around the island and the dungeons. <br></li><li>Original Soundtrack. <br></li><li>PvP Battles and Monster Trading: Prove your battle skills against players, and expand your collection through strategic monster trades.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Soul Dungeons shape themselves after their controller\u2019s soul, holding the key to the island's survival. The Belmonte family's control over these dungeons gives them power over the island, but rumors suggest their involvement with a cult and a connection to your parents' disappearance. As a hunter with hidden abilities, you're tasked not only with capturing monsters but also with aiding the island's inhabitants and uncovering your true identity.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1400750/extras/cfbdb117db27392cce2f320ae9b2550e.avif?t=1736188621\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Over 100 Ammons:</h2>There's a whole world of monsters just waiting to be captured. You might even be lucky enough to stumble upon a legendary Ammon! What's an Ammon? Ammo + Monster<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1400750/extras/0947be46c21e25d8ff95e187a7cdb150.avif?t=1736188621\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Legendary Casters:</h2>Legendary weapons known as casters are scattered around the island. These weapons, accessible to those fortunate enough to find them, hold immense power and allow for extraordinary battle strategies.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1400750/extras/a04e6555686f1ad26a13e92e5e55122c.avif?t=1736188621\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multiplayer:</h2>Though primarily a single-player experience, the game also offers multiplayer aspects.<br><br>- PvP Battles: <br>Prove your skill in PvP battles. Show your friends and fellow hunters who has the ultimate squad.<br><br>- Monster Trading: <br>Expand your Ammon collection by trading with friends and players worldwide. <br><strong></strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Designed for Virtual Reality!<br></li><li>Capture and catalog over 100 unique Ammons. <br></li><li>Voiced single player story<br></li><li>Turn Based ATB Combat System <br></li><li>Diverse Exploration Areas: Unearth secrets around the island and the dungeons. <br></li><li>Original Soundtrack. <br></li><li>PvP Battles and Monster Trading: Prove your battle skills against players, and expand your collection through strategic monster trades.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Cartridge Monsters: Rebirth is a VR Creature Collection RPG. Hunt and capture over 100 monsters across Phantom Island. Visit towns, complete quests, rank up, and clear dungeons in this single-player story.",
